flowchart LR
    Draft[Draft or imported content] --> Review[Owner review]
    Review --> Active[Approved active source]
    Active --> Index[Reindex]
    Index --> Answer[Cited answers]
    Answer --> Signals[Quality signals]
    Signals --> Backlog[Content review backlog]
    Backlog --> Review

    Signals -->|low confidence| Missing[Missing or weak content]
    Signals -->|stale citation| Stale[Review due]
    Signals -->|no results| Coverage[Coverage gap]
